                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is [i]Dark Souls[/i] through a [i]Legend of Dungeon[/i] filter. Deep combat, tight controls, beutifully-colorful pixel art with dynamic lighting, and item-borne lore. A roguelike whose charming aesthetic does not come off as gimmicky as many others of its ilk. The difficulty is relentless but fair, and the music and sound effects are expectedly old-school and immersive. If you enjoy [i]Risk of Rain[/i] and [i]Legend of Dungeon[/i], but wish they were more \"Souls-y\", [i]The Dungeoning[/i] should already be in your library.",
